p.src:
The mechanism AK extracts is simple: make something of yourself, be honest, treat people fairly, and become the kind of person whose words are worth hearing. In the language of these notes: $\mathrm{Influence}
\approx
g(\mathrm{competence},\mathrm{honesty},\mathrm{fairness},\mathrm{trust}).$ This is the same structure as the business lesson, but applied to public life. Capacity is not only labor capacity. There is also trust capacity: the ability to convene, persuade, and calm conflict because people believe one is not merely extracting from them.

